Prefix sums of 2^ω(n):
  S(10) = 23
  S(20) = 53
  S(30) = 89
  S(50) = 159
  S(100) = 359

Property checks:
  2^ω(6)=2^ω(2×3)=4 (should be 4)
  2^ω(30)=2^ω(2×3×5)=8 (should be 8)
  2^ω(4)=2^ω(2²)=2 (should be 2)
